@startuml
' Product Spec UC-5~UC-6, BR-5~BR-8, BR-13, AC-5, AC-8~AC-11
title UC-5~UC-6 — Fog of War and Player Map

start
:Activate map or receive move/vision-condition change;
:Calculate bounded Current Visibility;
if (Visibility calculation succeeds?) then (yes)
  :Update Explored Area;
else (no)
  :Fail closed;
  :Expose player origin only;
endif
:Filter hidden tokens, objects, and legend entries;
:Render prepared map and thin black grid outline;
:Render current visibility and explored area separately;
:Hide unexplored cells with Fog of War;
stop
@enduml
